        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-3214, Simple Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 7 finishes and with a simple, yet beautiful design, the Flat Face Cabinet Knob is the universal door pull. There is a finish to match any decor and with each finish, this simple cabinet knob takes on a new personality. In polished chrome and polished nickel finishes, it looks very modern; while oil rubbed bronze and antique english finishes grant it a more homey feel. No matter which finish you fall in love with, you can be certain that this RK International made cabinet pull will stand the test of time, both in design and in material.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-3214 Simple Flat Top Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
